# On atlas, credentials.json and calibration.json are SYMLINKS into
# /etc/atlas and /var/lib/atlas — the real files live outside the checkout so
# `git clean -fdx` deletes a link, not a running service's credentials.
# Mapping: docs/SETUP.md section 9.
credentials.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local runtime state: audio anywhere under lightshows/ (analyze/ scratch,
# tools/music.mp3), the GPU analysis venv, yt-dlp output, and the measured
# latency file play.py reads (a symlink into /var/lib/atlas on atlas).
*.mp3
.venv/
downloads/
calibration.json
